# Claude Code: share project-wide rules and hooks; keep local state ignored.
# Overrides the global .gitignore rules that exclude CLAUDE.md and all of .claude/.
!CLAUDE.md
!.claude/
!.claude/settings.json
!.claude/hooks/
!.claude/hooks/**
!.claude/rules/
!.claude/rules/**
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/worktrees/
